<% if event.is_a?(SnapshotEvent) %>
  <%= render partial: "snapshot_event_row", object: event, as: :event, locals: { items: items, storage_locs: storage_locs } %>
<% else %>
  <% from_loc = event.data.items.first&.from_storage_location %>
  <% to_loc = event.data.items.first&.to_storage_location %>
  <tr>
    <td>
      <%= event.user&.name || "Not recorded" %>
    </td>
    <%# `title="Internal Event ID: N"` used to sit on this cell. A `title` is browser chrome --
        silent on keyboard focus, gone on a timer, unstyleable -- and design.md says an app
        tooltip or nothing. Nothing: the internal id of an Event row is not something a diaper
        bank has any use for, and it was on the *whole cell*, so hovering the type text produced
        a number with no explanation. %>
    <td><%= event.type.sub(/Event/, '') %></td>
    <td>
      <%= link_to event.eventable_id, event.eventable, class: "font-medium text-brand-700 hover:text-brand-800" %>
    </td>
    <td><%= event.event_time.strftime("%Y/%m/%d %H:%M:%S %Z") %></td>
    <td>
      <% if from_loc %>
        <%= link_to storage_locs.find { |i| i.id == from_loc}.name, storage_location_path(from_loc), class: "font-medium text-brand-700 hover:text-brand-800" %>
      <% end %>
    </td>
    <td>
      <% if to_loc %>
        <%= link_to storage_locs.find { |i| i.id == to_loc}.name, storage_location_path(to_loc), class: "font-medium text-brand-700 hover:text-brand-800" %>
      <% end %>
    </td>
    <td>
      <% sorted_entries = event.data.items.sort_by do |entry|
          item = items.find { |i| i.id == entry.item_id }
          item&.name&.downcase || ''
        end %>
      <% sorted_entries.each do |entry| %>
        <% item = items.find { |i| i.id == entry.item_id } %>
        <% if item %>
          <%= link_to item.name, item_path(item.id), class: "font-medium text-brand-700 hover:text-brand-800" %>:
        <% else %>
          Item <%= entry.item_id %> (deleted)
        <% end %>
        <%= entry.from_storage_location == from_loc ? entry.quantity : -entry.quantity %><br>
      <% end %>
    </td>
    <%#
      The funnel used to sit inline in the "Refers to" cell, three pixels from the record link: a
      34x30 ghost *button* beside a 24px link, in the narrowest column of the table (93px), on 24
      of the 25 rows. Row actions belong in the actions column at `size-7`, which is what every
      other table does and what design.md requires -- see "Every visible control in an actions
      column". `essentials_row_icon_link` also gives it the `data-tooltip` it never had.
    %>
    <td class="cell-actions">
      <div class="flex justify-end gap-1.5">
        <%= essentials_row_icon_link "Show only this record's history",
              events_path(eventable_type: event.eventable_type, eventable_id: event.eventable_id),
              icon: "bi-funnel" %>
      </div>
    </td>
  </tr>
<% end %>
